       "submissionTime": "2026-10-30T11:23:57.000-05:00",
       "text": "I already had a Dell laptop that I was very happy with, but the motherboard got fried with a power surge when I took it to the beach on vacation.  After I cried for 2 days, I went looking for a new one and came across this laptop at Best Buy. Delivered to my door the next day, I shed one more tear for the one I had and loved and opened this new one.  DIdn't take long, fickle person that I am, I was in love with this one!  The black carbon finish feels really nice, not slippery like most.  It has twice the GB of my older one and is an i7 instead of an i5.  Easy to set up and get all my stuff back on, this baby loads like lightning and opening several tabs at once does nothing to slow it down. The only thing it does not have that my older one did have is a backlit keyboard, but I can live without that. I am VERY HAPPY with this product.  If I could choose any one I wanted, would I buy this one again?  Yes.",
